<title>NETHERLANDS: OPTIONS -- KLM options active on EOE.</title>
<headline>OPTIONS -- KLM options active on EOE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Options in KLM were active on the European Options Exchange (EOE) on Tuesday as investors looked to benefit in price swings following its results.</p>
<p>Market makers said investors were in the market for calls early on and selling puts against them. There was some profit-taking late in the session involving a reverse strategy.</p>
<p>KLM options acounted for 16 percent of total EOE business, with more than 10,000 calls and 5,000 puts changing hands.</p>
<p>Another dealer said ING call options were also in demand as the rally in the bond market prompted heavy demand.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsdesk +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
